{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026z88u04F26w1794887949.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今個星期冷鋒到，香港天氣轉冷？即睇天氣動態圖，了解未來幾日天氣如何轉變。</p><p></p><p>天文台預測，一道冷鋒會在明日稍後橫過華南沿岸，該區北風增強及有幾陣雨，氣溫顯著下降。受隨後的強烈東北季候風及一道雲雨帶影響，本週後期廣東地區普遍清涼，內陸地區早晚寒冷。預料一股達強風程度的偏東氣流會在下週初影響廣東沿岸。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"261117_HKO_APP_1030 - 截图2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/6e3b63f1ec3d4bdabacb5d19d44f8b87/snapshots/073dbc7b46a54ef2912665f52f6845c6-00002.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台預測，本港地區下午部分時間有陽光。今晚大致多雲。吹和緩東至東南風。展望明日稍後轉吹偏北風，晚上氣溫下降。隨後一兩日大致多雲，天氣顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫在15、16度左右，新界相當清涼。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"metra-11171130.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Nu66EWyp0F1794887150.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>更新時間： 2026年11月10日12時00分</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:09:10.807869+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":274,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T21:54:38.247036+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:02:33.889565+00:00","content_hash":"4f50548a5ce784a191b28c55822eeacffcbbed0a59550941bece8261fe1ff498","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:09:10.807869+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}